// Hand-written; qutegen never overwrites *_manual.go files.

// Package qtwebenginecore binds QtWebEngineCore, the Chromium-based web
// engine behind qtwebenginewidgets.QWebEngineView: pages, profiles, settings,
// history, scripts, downloads, cookies, URL scheme handlers and request
// interceptors. It is generated by cmd/qutegen from spec/.
//
// Qt requires a profile to outlive every page that uses it. A page built
// with NewQWebEnginePageWithProfile keeps its profile alive, and when GC
// collects both together the runtime frees the page first.
//
// Qt does not take ownership of what a CreateWindow override returns: give
// the new page a parent, or Keep it, for as long as it is used.
//
// Chromium runs in helper processes. Under QT_QPA_PLATFORM=offscreen, and in
// containers without user namespaces, set QTWEBENGINE_DISABLE_SANDBOX=1.
package qtwebenginecore
